{"4800640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clone. Optimize. Sacrifice.", "steam_appid": 4800640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SCIENTIFIC EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a humble laboratory into a thriving city of science and magic. Construct new buildings, automate production, expand your robotic workforce, and unlock powerful upgrades that fuel every part of your growing genetic enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLONE. OPTIMIZE. SACRIFICE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train heroes through automated dungeons, discover new classes, equip powerful items, and unlock game-changing passive abilities. When a clone reaches its limits, create a successor that inherits a portion of its power and continue the cycle of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR SCIENCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clone has a purpose. Recycle retired heroes to gain Science, level up your research, and unlock powerful blueprints, upgrades, and technologies that push your city to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE THROUGH THE RANKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your creations to the test in competitive auto-battle leagues, tackle increasingly difficult Coliseum challenges, and prove your genetic mastery against other players in PvP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE TO PLAY. DEEP TO MASTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy casual idle progression or relentless optimization, there's always another breakthrough waiting. Experiment with over 140 classes, 300 passive abilities, and thousands of items as you build the ultimate cloning program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR SCIENTIFIC EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a humble laboratory into a thriving city of science and magic. Construct new buildings, automate production, expand your robotic workforce, and unlock powerful upgrades that fuel every part of your growing genetic enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/85dce8a1e25c9a247897f652be3dc1c5.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLONE. OPTIMIZE. SACRIFICE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train heroes through automated dungeons, discover new classes, equip powerful items, and unlock game-changing passive abilities. When a clone reaches its limits, create a successor that inherits a portion of its power and continue the cycle of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/87a87f281c5b882f1cf81d23e489b284.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR SCIENCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clone has a purpose. Recycle retired heroes to gain Science, level up your research, and unlock powerful blueprints, upgrades, and technologies that push your city to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/ecdd4d6e83ff0444da2d745708ea3ee6.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE THROUGH THE RANKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your creations to the test in competitive auto-battle leagues, tackle increasingly difficult Coliseum challenges, and prove your genetic mastery against other players in PvP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.poster.avif?t=1786736099\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.webm?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/extras/170ebd43a3983476853930cce9f8450d.mp4?t=1786736099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE TO PLAY. DEEP TO MASTER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you enjoy casual idle progression or relentless optimization, there's always another breakthrough waiting. Experiment with over 140 classes, 300 passive abilities, and thousands of items as you build the ultimate cloning program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build a city of science and magic, power up cloned heroes through automated dungeons, inherit their strength through cloning, and recycle the rest for science in this casual idle city-builder with deep RPG progression and competitive auto-battle leagues.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/450cb88c2d17c8172598508cd195d345835d6073/header.jpg?t=1786736099", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/d0f8c751a83574f2d38046e5ca6d7f12a0ca44e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786736099", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4800640/d0f8c751a83574f2d38046e5ca6d7f12a0ca44e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786736099", "website": "http://www.gamesbyryan.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD 